SSAqua_Interior2_Text_Gentleman::
	.string "Bonjour!\n"
	.string "I am le waiter on this ship!\p"
	.string "I will be happy to serve you\n"
	.string "anything you please!\p"
	.string "… … …\n"
	.string "Ah! Le strong silent type!$"

SSAqua_Interior2_Text_Sailor2::
	.string "Here’s your cabin.\p"
	.string "If your POKéMON are hurt, take a\n"
	.string "nap in the bed.\l"
	.string "That will heal them.$"

SSAqua_Interior2_Text_Sailor3::
	.string "The passengers are all trainers.\p"
	.string "They’re all itching to battle in\n"
	.string "their cabins.$"

SSAqua_Interior2_Text_Trigger1_1::
	.string "PD: S.S.AQUA is en route to\n"
	.string "VERMILION CITY$"

SSAqua_Interior2_Text_Trigger1_2::
	.string "PD: S.S.AQUA is en route to\n"
	.string "OLIVINE CITY$"

SSAqua_Interior2_Text_Trigger3_1::
	.string "Excuse me, sir!$"

SSAqua_Interior2_Text_Trigger3_2::
	.string "Have you found the girl?\p"
	.string "...$"

SSAqua_Interior2_Text_Trigger3_3::
	.string "Oh... Crap...\p"
	.string "That was supposed to be our job.\p"
	.string "Why have you gotten in our way?\p"
	.string "We were supposed to kidnap that\n"
	.string "little girl and ask for ransom...\p"
	.string "You always blew up... brat...$"

SSAqua_Interior2_Text_Trigger3_4::
	.string "Yes, that’s right!$"

SSAqua_Interior2_Text_Trigger3_5::
	.string "Oh, thanks JAMIE!\n"
	.string "Now you blew up our cover...$"

SSAqua_Interior2_Text_Trigger3_6::
	.string "Hehe...\n"
	.string "Yes, we are...$"

SSAqua_Interior2_Text_Trigger3_7::
	.string "THAT’S RIGHT...\n"
	.string "TEAM ROCKET JESS & JAMIE!$"

SSAqua_Interior2_Text_Trigger3_8::
	.string "JESS: Oh well...\n"
	.string "Since you blew up our plans I\l"
	.string "guess we’ll have to teach you\l"
	.string "a lesson!\p"
	.string "Prepare to battle!$"

SSAqua_Interior2_Text_Trigger3_9::
	.string "JAMIE: Yes... That’s...$"

SSAqua_Interior2_Text_Trigger3_10::
	.string "JESS: Wh... WHAT IS GOING ON???$"

SSAqua_Interior2_Text_Trigger3_11::
	.string "JESS: WOAAAHHHH!!!$"

SSAqua_Interior2_Text_Trigger3_12::
	.string "And so...\n"
	.string "S.S. AQUA sinks to the bottom of\l"
	.string "the sea...\p"
	.string "Seems like everyone got out of the\n"
	.string "ship safely... but...\l"
	.string "What about {PLAYER}, JESS & JAMIE?...$"

SSAqua_Interior2_Text_Trigger4_1::
	.string "Whoa!\p"
	.string "Excuse me, son.\n"
	.string "I was in a hurry!\p"
	.string "My granddaughter is missing!\p"
	.string "She’s just a wee girl. If you see\n"
	.string "her, please let me know!$"

SSAqua_Interior2_Text_Trigger4_2::
	.string "Excuse me, sir!$"

SSAqua_Interior2_Text_Trigger4_3::
	.string "Did I hear well?\p"
	.string "Your granddaughter is missing?\p"
	.string "It means we SAILORS should take\n"
	.string "the job.\p"
	.string "We will find the girl in no time at\n"
	.string "all. You can trust us!$"

SSAqua_Interior2_Text_Trigger4_4::
	.string "...\p"
	.string "Oh well...\p"
	.string "I will be in my cabin, in case you\n"
	.string "need me!$"

SSAqua_Interior2_Text_Trigger8_1::
	.string "JESS: Great... Seems like we are\n"
	.string "trapped inside this ship in the\l"
	.string "middle of nowhere...\p"
	.string "What can we possibly do?$"

SSAqua_Interior2_Text_Trigger8_2::
	.string "JESS: JAMIE... What are you\n"
	.string "planning to do?$"
